<title>FRANCE: EU sets refund for daily soft wheat flour exports.</title>
<headline>EU sets refund for daily soft wheat flour exports.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union on Thursday set a refund of one Ecu per tonne on daily exports of soft wheat flour, France's grain office ONIC said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>The EU's grain panel meeting in Brussels also set a daily refund of 13 Ecus per tonne on rye exports to Switzerland and Liechtenstein, it said.</p>
<p>The EU also decided to apply a daily refund of five Ecus per tonne on barley exports to Switzerland and Liechtenstein, it said.</p>
<p>The wheat flour refund is fractionally less than the 1.19 Ecus implied by the EU's usual coefficient for flour refunds of 1.37 when compared to wheat grain refunds.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +331 4221 5432</p>
</text>
